WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.480 --> 00:00:08.120
Dana Ruiz: Thanks for making the time today. How has the week been since we last spoke?

2
00:00:08.640 --> 00:00:16.900
Bob Smith: It started badly. Monday was the review meeting and I could not stop replaying it afterwards.

3
00:00:17.400 --> 00:00:22.050
Dana Ruiz: Replaying it how? Walk me through what was going through your head.

4
00:00:22.600 --> 00:00:33.140
Bob Smith: Mostly that everyone in the room could tell I was struggling, and that it was only a matter of time before someone said something about it.

5
00:01:34.020 --> 00:01:41.780
Dana Ruiz: That sounds like the thought we wrote down last time. Did you get a chance to put it through the thought record?

6
00:01:42.300 --> 00:01:52.660
Bob Smith: I did, twice. The second time it actually helped. I wrote down that nobody had said anything, and the tightness eased off a bit.

7
00:02:53.100 --> 00:03:02.480
Dana Ruiz: That is worth noticing. Let us keep it going this week and see whether the evening replaying settles as well.
